{
  "Vanilla with Sprinkles": [
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::199443206",
      "Source": "Structure Variant Gun",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑变体枪","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::778282959",
      "Source": "Manage <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">structure skin</> variants with one of these.<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Variant Swap:</> Cycles between skin variants<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Orientation Swap:</> Rotates the skin in all enabled axis.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Flip:</> Flips the skin in all enabled axis.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Copy/Paste:</> Copy and paste skins between structures.<#RN#><#RN#>Enable <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Multi Target</> to propogate changes to connected structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"长按R 使用其中之一管理<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">建筑皮肤</>变体。<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">变体切换：</>在皮肤变体间循环切换<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">方向切换：</>在所有启用的轴向上旋转皮肤。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">翻转：</>在所有启用的轴向上翻转皮肤。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">复制/粘贴：</>在建筑间复制和粘贴皮肤。<#RN#><#RN#>启用<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">多目标</>以将更改传播到连接的建筑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3198953313",
      "Source": "Crafting Skill Tonic",
      "Trans": {"SC":"制作药水","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3947855488",
      "Source": "Consume this to temporarily become a master of crafting.<#RN#><#RN#>Level-up points will be temporarily redistributed entirely into crafting upon consumption.<#RN#><#RN#>Weight max will remain unaffected.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"饮用此物可暂时成为制作大师。<#RN#><#RN#>饮用后，升级点数将暂时全部分配至制作技能。<#RN#><#RN#>最大负重将不受影响。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2771323585",
      "Source": "Dino Management Gun",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐龙管理枪","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1835426135",
      "Source": "Manage dinos with one of these!<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Kill:</> Attempt to kill aimed dino(s).<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Spay:</> Attempt to spay/neuter aimed dino(s).<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Mating:</> Toggle mating on aimed dino(s).<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Claim:</> Attempt to claim aimed dino(s).<#RN#><#RN#>Enable <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Multi Target</> to propogate changes to nearby dinos.<#RN#>Enable <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Species Filter</> while in <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Multi Target</> to propogate changes to nearby dinos of only the same type.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"长按R 使用其中之一来管理恐龙！<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">击杀：</>尝试击杀瞄准的恐龙。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">绝育：</>尝试对瞄准的恐龙进行绝育。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">交配：</>切换瞄准的恐龙的交配状态。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">认领：</>尝试认领瞄准的恐龙。<#RN#><#RN#>启用<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">多目标</>以将更改传播到附近的恐龙。<#RN#>在<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">多目标</>模式下启用<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">物种过滤器</>，仅将更改传播到同种类的附近恐龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1621146405",
      "Source": "Structure Pickup Gun",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建筑拾取枪","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1338889761",
      "Source": "Pick up structures with one of these.<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Pickup:</> Attempt to pick up aimed structure(s). If repairs are required, this will attempt to perform repairs before picking up. Repairs must succeed (if needed) for pickup.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Repair:</> Attempt to repair aimed structure(s).<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Demolish:</> Demolish aimed structure(s).<#RN#><#RN#>Will attempt to pull resources from nearby containers/dinos for repairs.<#RN#><#RN#>Platform structures can be guarded against modification. Defaults to enabled.<#RN#><#RN#>Enable <RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">Multi Target</> to propogate changes to connected structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"长按R 使用其中之一来拾取建筑。<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">拾取：</>尝试拾取瞄准的建筑。如果需要维修，则会在拾取前尝试进行维修。维修必须成功（如果需要）才能拾取。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">维修：</>尝试维修瞄准的建筑。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">拆除：</>拆除瞄准的建筑。<#RN#><#RN#>将尝试从附近的容器/恐龙中提取资源以进行维修。<#RN#><#RN#>平台建筑可被保护以防止修改。默认启用。<#RN#><#RN#>启用<RichColor Color=\"0.6, 0.6, 1, 1\">多目标</>以将更改传播到连接的建筑。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
